<title>USA: Mothers Work Nov same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Mothers Work Nov same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		    $19.2	    $15.623.1   5.7</p>
<p>Year-to-date	   n/a	    n/a	 n/an/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Same-store sales at 386 maternity clothing stores rose 5.7 percent for period, compared with 8.6 percent at 144 stores a year earlier. Same-store sales at 18 Episode(R) America non-maternity clothing stores fell 14 percent.</p>
<p>    Month is	 Nov weeks ended n/a</p>
<p>    Full company name is   Mothers Work Inc</p>
